zunterkunft-12672\t\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/LocalBusiness\">\n <!-- <figure class=\"item-image\">\n\t\t\t</figure> -->\n <!-- header -->\n <header class=\"item-header\">\n  <h3 class=\"item-headline\" itemprop=\"name\"><small>geschlechtsunabhängige Schutzwohnungen</small> <small>in München</small>\n   <br>\n   TIN* Schutzunterkunft</h3>\n </header>\n <!-- content -->\n <div class=\"item-content\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n   <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n    Adresse\n    <br>\n    <small> d. Träger </small>\n   </div>\n   <address class=\"col-xs-8\" itemprop=\"address\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/PostalAddress\"><span itemprop=\"parentOrganization\">Frauenhilfe München gemeinnützige GmbH</span>\n    <br>\n    <span itemprop=\"streetAddress\">Charles-de-Gaulle-Str. 4</span>\n    <br>\n    <span itemprop=\"postalCode\">81737</span><span itemprop=\"addressLocality\">München</span>\n    <br></address>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"row\">\n   <div class=\"col-xs-4\">Plätze</div>\n   <div class=\"col-xs-8\">5</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"row\">\n   <div class=\"col-xs-4\">E-Mail</div>\n   <div class=\"col-xs-8\">\n    <a href=\"mailto:info@tin-muenchen.de\" itemprop=\"email\">info@tin-muenchen.de</a>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"col-xs-4\">Telefon</div>\n   <div class=\"col-xs-8\">\n    <a href=\"tel:089%2035%2048%203-260\" itemprop=\"telephone\">089 35 48 3-260</a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- hidden button to trigger map -->\n  <button class=\"js-wpv-addon-maps-focus-map js-toolset-maps-open-infowindow-map-map-bs-marker-marker-12672 d-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-map=\"map-bs\" data-marker=\"marker-12672\"></button>\n  <!-- toggle button (triggers hidden button above via js) -->\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"toggle-button small\" data-toggle=\"#mse-content-tin-schutzunterkunft-12672\"><span class=\"fa fa-arrow-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> Mehr erfahren</button>\n </div>\n <!-- toggle content -->\n <div class=\"item-content toggle-content\" id=\"mse-content-tin-schutzunterkunft-12672\">\n  <div class=\"\" itemprop=\"description\">\n   <p class=\"\">Die TIN*-Schutzunterkunft ist ein Projekt der Frauen*hilfe München. Sie bietet trans*, intergeschlechtlichen und nicht-binären Personen* Schutz, Unterstützung und die Möglichkeit, sich aus einer gewaltvollen Lebenssituation zu lösen.</p>\n  </div>\n  <!-- url -->\n  <div class=\"row\">\n   <div class=\"col-xs-4\">Internet</div>\n   <div class=\"col-xs-8 item-link\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.tin-muenchen.de/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" itemprop=\"url\">https://www.tin-muenchen.de/</a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:none\" class=\"wpv-addon-maps-marker js-wpv-addon-maps-marker js-wpv-addon-maps-marker-marker-12672 js-wpv-addon-maps-markerfor-map-bs\" data-marker=\"marker-12672\" data-markertitle=\"TIN* Schutzunterkunft\" data-markerfor=\"map-bs\" data-markerlat=\"48.102205\" data-markerlon=\"11.64386\" data-markericon=\"https://www.maennergewaltschutz.de/files/2023/08/marker-icon-grey.png\" data-markericonhover=\"\" data-streetview=\"no\" data-fromview=\"\">\n <div class=\"map-info-window left\">\n  <h4><small>Träger</small>\n   <br>\n   TIN* Schutzunterkunft</h4>\n  <address>Frauenhilfe München gemeinnützige GmbH\n   <br>\n   Charles-de-Gaulle-Str. 4\n   <br>\n   81737 München</address>\n  <p>Telefon: <a href=\"tel:089%2035%2048%203-260\">089 35 48 3-260</a>\n   <br>\n   E-Mail: <a href=\"mailto:info@tin-muenchen.de\">info@tin-muenchen.de</a></p>\n  <a href=\"https://www.tin-muenchen.de/\" class=\"button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"TIN* Schutzunterkunft\">zur Internetseite</a>\n  <br>\n </div>\n</div>\n<!-- Entry -->\n<div id=\"mse-maennerschutzwohnung-12685\" class=\"\n\t\tactive\n\t\tcol-xs-12 col-sm-6 item-container position-relative transition\n\t\t filtered-plz-64283\t\t filtered-freie-plaetze-z \t\t filtered-angebotstyp-1\t\tpost_name-maennerschutzwohnung-12685\t\" itemscope itemtype=\"h